        <ids:property instructions="1959b280d1ff11e1800000215ad4efdf : Height || Height of the object. It is the upper hight of the railing above the floor or stair.&#10;The size information is provided in addition to the shape representation and the geometric parameters used within. In cases of inconsistency between the geometric parameters and the size properties, provided in the attached property set, the geometric parameters take precedence." datatype="IFCPOSITIVELENGTHMEASURE" minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="unbounded">
